---
description: Habblaud virtual office is available for this Cursor workspace
alwaysApply: true
---

Habblaud is installed as a Cursor plugin and should stay running while you work.

- Office UI: http://localhost:4747
- Cursor agent sessions appear as characters with a CURSOR badge
- The Habblaud server is kept alive by plugin hooks on session start and tool use
- Do not treat Habblaud as a remote service; it only talks to 127.0.0.1 on this machine
- If the office is down, tell the user to run `npm run cursor:install` and `npm start` in the Habblaud repo, or open http://localhost:4747 after install
